# Main Strand Data Processing Utility

This script demonstrates a simple data processing pipeline using the Strand language.

```strand
import io;
import transform;

// Define the main processing function
function processData(inputData) {
  // Initialize the transformation pipeline
  pipeline = transform.Pipeline();
  
  // Add transformations
  pipeline.addStep(
    function(data) {
      return data.filter(function(item) {
        return item.value > 10;
      });
    }
  );
  
  pipeline.addStep(
    function(data) {
      return data.map(function(item) {
        return item.value * 2;
      });
    }
  );
  
  // Execute the pipeline
  result = pipeline.execute(inputData);
  
  return result;
}

// Main entry point
function main() {
  // Read input data from stdin
  inputData = io.readAll();
  
  // Process the data
  processedData = processData(inputData);
  
  // Output the result
  io.write(processedData);
}

// Run the main function
main();
```
